      "parameters": {
        "width": 576,
        "height": 736,
        "content": "## How it works\n\nThis workflow automatically captures real estate leads from a website or frontend form using a webhook. It extracts and validates customer details like email, phone number, and budget before processing. Valid leads are stored in PostgreSQL and analyzed using OpenAI to calculate lead score and lead type (HOT/WARM/COLD).\n\nThe workflow then assigns the appropriate sales agent based on location, updates the database, and identifies high-priority leads. Customers receive instant email and SMS/WhatsApp confirmation messages, while the sales team receives Slack notifications for hot leads. A follow-up reminder email is also sent automatically after a waiting period.\n\n## Setup steps\n\n1. Configure the Webhook node for lead form submission.\n2. Connect PostgreSQL database credentials.\n3. Add OpenAI API credentials for AI lead scoring.\n4. Configure Gmail credentials for customer emails.\n5. Configure Twilio for SMS/WhatsApp notifications.\n6. Connect Slack credentials for sales team alerts.\n7. Activate the workflow and test using Postman or frontend forms."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    }
